    Note over FE,DB: RULED OUT as a cause: MongoDB itself.<br/>Direct probe same session: connect 673ms, ping 50ms,<br/>93 cases total. Contributing factor: 12-17 populate<br/>paths per request = 12-17x the exposure to hitting<br/>ONE dead connection, vs. a single-query endpoint's 1x.
